                                                "sense_id": "084112ed-88b6-3472-b153-0c64d14d4464",
                                                "text": "I then had the two best tarriers beneath the canopy; this poor crater is their daughter,\" and he patted the dog's head affectionately."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d5c80c19-2670-43f5-8a85-f91389de923d",
                                                "sense_id": "084112ed-88b6-3472-b153-0c64d14d4464",
                                                "text": "She is a charming crater; I would venture to say that, if I was not her father."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac679f24-1052-453e-9105-95d2e60eef35",
                                                "sense_id": "084112ed-88b6-3472-b153-0c64d14d4464",
                                                "text": "‘Then why not stop for fellow-craters—going to thy own father’s house too, as we be, and knowen us so well?’"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
